Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(examples): add the catalog case 2d/contour-tabs

A 90 x 50 x 6 mm plate that one 2D Contour cuts out of a sheet, with
an arc lead-in, a linear lead-out and four tabs. The test
contour_tabs_case_posts_the_lead_moves_and_the_tab_lifts pins the
lead moves and the tab lifts of the posted program.

Fixes #2859

